# Optional: enable remote code execution for non-JS/HTML languages by pointing
# at a Piston instance (https://github.com/engineer-man/piston) base URL.
# JavaScript and HTML always run locally in a sandbox and need no config.
# The public emkc.org endpoint is whitelist-only since Feb 2026, so self-host:
#   VITE_PISTON_URL=https://your-piston-host/api/v2/piston
# VITE_PISTON_URL=
